  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/tarball/v0.120.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/zipball/v0.120.0",
  "body": "### Added Features\n\n- Mark SLES as a comprehensive distro [PR [#3732](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3732) @willmurphyscode]\n- Store NVD SSVC decision points in a new v6 decorator table [PR [#3725](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3725) @wagoodman]\n- Adding Locations column to html template which help with triaging [PR [#3092](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3092) @santrancisco]\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- sign release checksums with a sigstore bundle [PR [#3759](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3759) @wagoodman]\n- chainguard osv package ecosystem should be package type [PR [#3758](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3758) @kzantow]\n- include qualifiers for unaffected packages [PR [#3734](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3734) @kzantow]\n- render TUI log lines on their own rows, with colors and a small header [PR [#3735](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3735) @wagoodman]\n- `match.dpkg.using-cpes` (and `match.rpm.using-cpes`) is accepted but has no effect [Issue [#3746](https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/3746)] [PR [#3747](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3747) @amitschendel]\n- embedded spaces in bin location breaks install.sh [Issue [#2809](https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/2809)] [PR [#3738](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3738) @bIackr0se]\n- False positives: --add-cpes-if-none maps tomcat-embed-el to apache:tomcat CPE [Issue [#3730](https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/3730)]\n- `match.rpm.using-cpes` has no effect [Issue [#3752](https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/3752)] [PR [#3753](https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/3753) @amitschendel]\n- Import metadata digest is not in the expected format [Issue [#3388](https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/3388)]\n- Issue Pulling DB update [Issue [#3586](https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/3586)]\n\n### Dependencies\n\n88 dependency changes (59 updated, 27 added, 2 removed). 2 vulnerabilities remediated.\n\n**🟢 Remediated (2)**\n\n- [GHSA-8wmf-6v46-5gfg](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8wmf-6v46-5gfg) (Low) — go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace, go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp, go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk\n- [GHSA-pg57-6jwg-q645](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-pg57-6jwg-q645) (Medium) — github.com/containerd/containerd/v2\n\n**Toolchains (1)**\n\n- Go minimum version: `1.26.3` → `1.26.8`\n\n<details>\n<summary>Updated (59 packages)</summary>\n\n- github.com/Microsoft/hcsshim `v0.15.0-rc.1` → `v0.15.0-rc.4`\n- github.com/anchore/bubbly `v0.2.1` → `v0.2.2`\n- github.com/anchore/go-logger `v0.1.1` → `v0.2.0`\n- github.com/anchore/go-rpmdb `v0.2.0` → `v0.2.1`\n- github.com/anchore/stereoscope `v0.3.2` → `v0.3.3`\n- github.com/anchore/syft `v1.52.0` → `v1.54.0`\n- github.com/bmatcuk/doublestar/v4 `v4.10.0` → `v4.10.2`\n- github.com/containerd/containerd/api `v1.11.1` → `v1.12.0`\n- github.com/containerd/containerd/v2 `v2.3.5` → `v2.4.1` **(🟢 remediated [GHSA-pg57-6jwg-q645](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-pg57-6jwg-q645))**\n- github.com/containerd/log `v0.1.0` → `v0.2.0`\n- github.com/containerd/ttrpc `v1.2.8` → `v1.2.9`\n- github.com/containerd/typeurl/v2 `v2.2.3` → `v2.3.0`\n- github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin `v0.6.1` → `v0.7.0`\n- github.com/docker/cli `v29.8.0+incompatible` → `v29.8.1+incompatible`\n- github.com/docker/docker-credential-helpers `v0.9.5` → `v0.9.8`\n- github.com/dustin/go-humanize `v1.0.1` → `v1.1.0`\n- github.com/erofs/go-erofs `v0.3.0` → `v0.3.1`\n- github.com/felixge/httpsnoop `v1.0.4` → `v1.1.0`\n- github.com/fsnotify/fsnotify `v1.9.0` → `v1.10.1`\n- github.com/glebarez/go-sqlite `v1.22.0` → `v1.23.0`\n- github.com/go-jose/go-jose/v4 `v4.1.4` → `v4.1.5`\n- github.com/go-logr/logr `v1.4.3` → `v1.4.4`\n- github.com/grpc-ecosystem/grpc-gateway/v2 `v2.28.0` → `v2.30.0`\n- github.com/hashicorp/hcl/v2 `v2.24.0` → `v2.25.0`\n- github.com/magiconair/properties `v1.18.11` → `v1.18.12`\n- github.com/mattn/go-runewidth `v0.0.21` →